## Day 3: `src/outcome_model.py`

Ye `treatment_model.py` jaisa hi wrapper hai, bas outcome ke liye. Outcome model sirf X (confounders) se `P(Y=1 | X)` predict karta hai, jaisa plan mein likha tha.

**1.** Nayi file banao:
