## Handbook kya kehta hai
- **Main branch** progress tracking ke liye hai, aur usme sabki final merged code honi chahiye.
- Individual branches ko review karke **main mein merge karna Team Lead ka kaam hai**, yaani tumhara.
- Commit days ki ginti ke liye merge zaroori nahi hai. Dashboard sabhi branches ke commits ek jagah dikhata hai.

Isse ek correction bhi banta hai. Work Distribution Document mein maine likha tha "Merge to main only at the end review", par handbook mein merge ka koi aisa timing nahi diya hai. Wo line mera andaza thi, to PDF se hata do (ya "merged by the Team Lead for progress tracking" likh do). Chaho to main PDF dobara bana dungi.

## Dhyan rakhne wali baat: conflicts aayenge
Meine branch listings mein dekha hai ki kuch files do branches mein hain:
- `src/dml_estimation.py` aur `docs/dml_results.md` **hepsiba** aur **sekhar** dono ki branch par hain, to merge mein conflict aayega.
- `src/nuisance_models.py` hepsiba ki branch par purana version hai, aur tumhari branch par naya.

Isliye ek saath sab merge karne ki koshish mat karo. Conflict galat resolve ho gaya to kisi ka kaam ud sakta hai.

## Safe tareeka (GitHub website par, Pull Request se)
1. **Pehle apni branch:** GitHub par repo kholo, **Pull requests**, **New pull request**, `base: main` aur `compare: vridhi-gautam`. Agar "Able to merge" dikhe, to **Create pull request** aur phir **Merge**. Sirf tumhari files jayengi, to conflict ka risk kam hai.
2. **Phir ek-ek karke** `jaswanth`, `sekhar`, `hepsiba`. Har PR mein "Able to merge" dikhe tabhi merge karo.
3. **Agar "This branch has conflicts" dikhe, to merge mat karo.** Us member ko batao ki wo apni branch par `main` pull karke conflict khud theek kare, ya mentor ki help lo.
4. **Force push (`git push --force`) kabhi mat karna.**

## Aaj ke liye meri salah
Review mein time kam hai to:
- Pehle **sirf apni branch ka PR** merge karo. Ye 2 minute ka kaam hai.
- Baaki teen ke merge review ke baad karo, aur conflict aaye to mentor ko dikha do.
- Mentor se bhi pooch lo ki unhe review ke waqt `main` mein kitna dikhna chahiye.

Ye bhi batao ki pichhle message wala 14 din ka combined count kitna aaya. Phir review se pehle demo ek baar test kar lete hain.

