Mujhe pakka nahi pata. Handbook mein sirf itna likha hai ki Work Distribution Document mid review se pehle submit hona chahiye, par kahan submit karna hai wo nahi likha. Dashboard ke jo screenshots tumne bheje, unme bhi koi document upload ka option nahi dikha (sirf Project, GitHub, Write-ups aur Commits tabs the).

## Kahan ho sakta hai (isi order mein check karo)
1. **Infotact dashboard, Projects page:** wahan "View project details" aur "See training plan" ke links the. Dekho unme kahin "Work Distribution" ya document upload ka option hai.
2. **Mentor ya Infotact ka WhatsApp/email:** handbook ke hisaab se dashboard credentials bhi email ya WhatsApp se aaye the, to submission bhi wahi hota hoga.
3. **GitHub repo:** kai batch mein ye document repo ke `docs/` folder mein rakhne ko kaha jaata hai.

## Abhi kya karo
Mentor ko ye ek line bhejo (ya review ke time pooch lo):

> Hi, where should we submit the Work Distribution Document for Group 36 (ITS/DSML/1247)? Should it be uploaded on the dashboard, emailed, or committed to the repo?

Jab tak jawab na aaye, safe option ye hai ki PDF ko repo mein bhi rakh do. Isse commit bhi valid hoga (50 se zyada characters badalte hain) aur document kisi bhi review ke liye ready rahega:

1. PDF download karo aur `docs` folder mein `Work_Distribution_Document.pdf` naam se copy karo.
2. Repo ke andar:
```bash
git add docs/Work_Distribution_Document.pdf
git commit -m "Add Work Distribution Document (Weeks 1-3)"
git push
```

Mentor jo jagah bataye wahan bhi submit kar dena. Review mein poochhe to bol sakti ho: "Document ready hai, submission ki jagah confirm kar rahe hain."

Ye ho jaye to **demo taiyar** aur **viva practice** par chalte hain.

